e\r\n      public InteractionResultHolder<ItemStack> use(Level level, Player player, InteractionHand interactionHand) {\r\n         ItemStack itemStack = player.getItemInHand(interactionHand);\r\n         Optional<Holder<Instrument>> optional = this.getInstrument(itemStack);\r\n         if (optional.isPresent()) {\r\n            Instrument instrument = optional.get().value();\r\n            player.startUsingItem(interactionHand);\r\n            InstrumentItem.play(level, player, instrument);\r\n            player.getCooldowns().addCooldown(this, instrument.useDuration());\r\n            return InteractionResultHolder.consume(itemStack);\r\n         }\r\n         return InteractionResultHolder.fail(itemStack);\r\n      }\r\n      ..."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If we look at the above class, we can see that the "},{"type":"text","text":"awardStat()","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" method (the method responsible for incrementing player statistics) is never called throughout this piece of code, thus making minecraft.used:minecraft.goat_horn not increase when using goat horns."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fix:","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Simply calling the "},{"type":"text","text":"awardStat()","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" method where appropriate within this piece of code will resolve this problem. The following line of code can be used to fix this issue."}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"java"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"player.awardStat(Stats.ITEM_USED.get(this));"}]}]},"customfield_10054":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10023","value":"Confirmed","id":"10023"},"fixVersions":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/version/10498","id":"10498","description":"","name":"22w42a","archived":true,"released":true,"releaseDate":"2022-10-18"}